# Proposal Totals — Live (draft) + Frozen (committed)

Hybrid model. A proposal is a price commitment, but while it is a draft it must behave like before
(update live as you edit).

## Behaviour by status

| Status | Totals source |
|---|---|
| `draft` | **LIVE** — recomputed from lines/adjustments on every edit (the `totals` useMemo in ProposalDetail; `proposal_list_totals` RPC for the list; live compute in ProposalPrint). Updates instantly, no button. |
| `sent` / `accepted` | **FROZEN** — read the snapshot columns on `Proposals`, committed at send time. A "Locked" badge is shown; content is read-only. |

The quote-derived base is frozen in `ProposalLines.quote_line_snapshot.base_line_msrp` at proposal
creation, so even the LIVE draft total is immune to later Quote edits.

## Freezing (the moment totals are committed)

In `ProposalDetail.saveHeader`, when status transitions draft → sent/accepted, the current LIVE
`totals` are written into the snapshot columns in the same UPDATE:

| Column | Live value written |
|---|---|
| `total_product_amount` | `totals.totalProduct` (Material+Custom, pre-discount) |
| `discount_amount` | `totals.discountAmount` |
| `installation_amount` | `totals.installationNet` |
| `subtotal_amount` | `totals.subtotal` (taxable base) |
| `tax_amount` | `totals.taxAmount` |
| `total_amount` | `totals.total` |

From then on every surface (detail Summary, list, PDF) reads these columns for that proposal.

## Live rule (drafts) — must stay in sync across the 3 surfaces

`totals` (ProposalDetail), `proposal_list_totals` (RPC, used by the list) and ProposalPrint's live
compute all implement the SAME formula:
- `from_quote` line = `base_line_msrp` (snapshot) or live QuoteLine MSRP fallback, `× (1 + line_adjustment_pct/100)`.
- `custom` line = `qty × unit_price`.
- Global discount applies to `subtotal_before_discount` (product + installation net + other add-ons).
- Installation net = `installation_total × (1 - labor_disc%) × (1 + labor_fee%)`.
- Tax from `CostSettings.tax_pct` (exempt_tax aware); global fee added after tax.

If you change this formula, change it in **all three** places or the list/detail/PDF will disagree.

## Do / Don't

1. **Do NOT** re-add auto-recalc triggers. They were dropped on purpose
   (`trg_proposal_lines_recalc_totals`, `trg_proposal_line_addons_recalc_totals`,
   `trg_proposals_recalc_totals`). Draft totals are live in the app; committed totals are frozen at send.
2. **Do NOT** run any recompute against a `sent`/`accepted` proposal — it would overwrite the
   committed amount (e.g. PR-00197=16,637.60, PR-00214=38,016.78).
3. List/detail/PDF must agree: drafts via the live RPC/compute, locked via the snapshot.
4. `proposal_recalc_totals_v2` exists in DB but is NOT used by the UI (legacy of an earlier
   button-based design). Do not wire it into the live flow.
